# gzport never distributes anything of the game: no game files, no saves, no keys, no dumps.
# Everything below stays on your PC. Check with `git status --ignored` before a commit.

# ---- Game dumps and PS4 content ----
# Dump folders at the top (CUSA02046, CUSA02046-patch, CUSA02046-full, ...), any title ID
/CUSA*/
/[A-Z][A-Z][A-Z][A-Z][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]*/
# Add-ons (DLC) and the folders the launcher fills from .pkg files
/dlc/
/addcont/
# Game files anywhere in the tree
eboot.bin
*.elf
*.self
*.prx
*.sprx
param.sfo
*.sfo
*.trp
*.pac
*.at9
*.mp4
*.pkg
*.dcx
# Game textures and menus (also what mods ship of them)
*.dds
*.tpf
*.gfx
sce_sys/
sce_module/
# Archives of game or user files
*.7z
/*.zip
*.rar

# ---- Saves, trophies and everything a run writes ----
# The user folder of runs from source: savedata, trophies, shader cache, add-on links
user/
savedata/
savedata-backups/
SAVEDATA*/
*.sav
# Logs of runs (they hold your paths, your GPU and sometimes your account name)
/logs/
last_run.log
/message*.txt
perf.data

# ---- Settings, accounts and keys ----
# Your settings: the game's ini and the launcher's (when kept in the checkout)
bbport.ini
*.ini.local
settings.json
# Environment files (accounts, passwords, server keys)
.env
.env.*
*.env
# Keys and account files: trophy key, shadNet passwords, registration keys, certificates
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
accounts.txt
registration.key
trophy_key*
TrophyKey*

# ---- Build outputs ----
out/
/dist/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
pgo/
/*.spv
packaging/runtime-paths.nix
vkd3d-proton.cache
*.orig

# ---- Third-party files you provide yourself (never redistributed) ----
# AMD FSR 4.1.1 (built from your own DLLs) and NVIDIA DLSS
fsr4_411/
fsr4_shaders/
*.dll
tools/fsr4cap/*.exe
*.png
mods.json
patches.json
/mods/

# ---- Local work ----
# Agent worktrees, scratch helpers
/.claude/
/scratch/
/1060/

# ---- Bloodborne leftovers kept only on this PC ----
# bbport's co-op bridge, its co-op server guide and notes of bbport's first game
/bbbridge/
/BBPORT.ru.md
/docs/SERVER.md
/docs/EMULATION_REMOVAL_PLAN.ru.md
# bbport's first game's profile, co-op helpers and code hooks (out of the build)
/gpu/games/bloodborne.cpp
/gpu/bbnet/include/core/bloodborne_re.h
/gpu/shim/bbport_gnm_table.inc
/gpu/shim/bbport_gnm_hooks.*
/gpu/shim/bbport_guest_hooks.*
/gpu/shim/bbport_game_menu.*
/tools/re/gen_gnm_table.py
/tools/re/gnm_names.txt
/docs/savedata_route/
/docs/route*.txt
/docs/route_run.log
/bloodborne_upscalers_*.md
/docs/ISSUE_ACTION_PLAN_*.md
